\newlabel{fig:method}{{1}{3}{The four-arm replay at one interaction point. The recorded prefix is forced up to $h_t$; from the intervened decision on, the loop runs live. $H$ arm: model re-queried under the flipped context (total effect); $Ha$ arm: flip paired with the \emph {original} action forced (direct effect; fourth cell, pre-reg 40); $M$ and $HM$ arms force the sampled alternative $a'$. \emph {Screening-off} is the event $C_{HM} = C_M$}{figure.1}{}}
