\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Total vs.\ direct harness effect (pre-reg 40 and 42 rows). (a) Harness-pivotal V1 points: designed pool by regime, external 4B (crosses) and 8B (triangles); mediated points sit on $C_{Ha} = 0$, the 8B's screening breaks near the diagonal $C_{Ha} = C_H$. (b) Per population, the pivotal points split into the expected stratum ($H_w = 0$, grey), and the informative stratum with $C_{Ha} = 0$ (solid) or $\neq  0$ (light); $k/n$ of the informative stratum annotated. (c) V2, 48 points by type: termination lies on the diagonal (0/10). Jitter $\sigma = 0.015$.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
