\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces T1 --- positioning. $^{\mathrm  {off}}$Checkpointed paired replay used offline to train an amortized estimator; disabled at decision time. $^{\mathrm  {s}}$CAR measures step--step interaction (Shapley) \emph  {within} one layer, not across the model/harness boundary. $^{\ast }$Joint harness+weights training without per-decision causal measurement. $^{\mathrm  {m}}$Observes that counterfactual \emph  {measurability} is model-dependent, within a single layer; no cross-layer structure. $^{\dagger }$Tested with dose-matched controls and pre-registration; the outcome is an identified negative (\S  \ref  {sec:training}).}}{33}{table.9}\protected@file@percent }
